OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fgradually dying out this evening. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will be dry with
OL,8,Fvariable amounts of cloud. Brisk
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds easing later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FA largely dry start but then
OL,12,Fwidespread rain, occasionally heavy,
OL,13,Fwill spread northeast late from late
OL,14,Fmorning. Drier and clearer weather
OL,15,Fwill spread from the west during the
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
